  "body": "This beautifully presented weatherboard freestanding home offers 204sqm of floor area on a freehold site, combining timeless coastal charm with the comfort and convenience of modern living. Thoughtfully updated and immaculately maintained, it presents a near-new feel with all the hard work already done.\r\n\r\nBathed in natural light, the home welcomes you with a grand entrance foyer and soaring ceilings that create an immediate sense of space. The open-plan living and dining area flows effortlessly through large sliding doors to a sun-drenched deck, private patio, and easy-care landscaped gardens - ideal for entertaining friends or simply relaxing in peace.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the stylish kitchen features quality Belling appliances, generous bench space, and a practical layout designed for everyday living and effortless hosting.\r\n\r\nOffering three Bedrooms + Spacious Study / Fourth Room, three beautifully appointed bathrooms with underfloor heating, and a separate laundry, there's plenty of room for family, guests, or working from home.\r\n\r\nFully double glazed and tastefully modernised throughout, this low-maintenance home is designed for a lock-and-leave lifestyle without compromising on comfort. A carpeted double garage with solid timber doors and additional off-street parking completes the package.\r\n\r\nJust minutes from the beach, local cafés, parks, shops, and excellent schools, this move-in-ready home offers the perfect balance of lifestyle, convenience, and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a busy family, downsizer, or frequent traveller, this is the easy-care coastal home you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nContact Rachel Zhang today to arrange your private viewing.",
